FTM Surgery – List of Surgeons in the USA
FTM Surgery refers to “female-to-male” surgery, a broad group of gender-affirming procedures for trans masculine and non-binary individuals. Top Surgery is the most common FTM procedure and is often the only surgical step taken in gender transition. Other FTM surgeries include Hysterectomy and the genital reconstructive procedures known as Metoidioplasty and Phalloplasty. Learn more about FTM Surgery »

Looking for a surgeon? FTM Surgery has become more common in recent years, but it can still be tough to narrow down the surgeons that are best suited to your needs. The surgeons listed here are qualified plastic and reconstructive surgeons and urologists in the United States who offer FTM Surgery procedures.

Dr. Steven Ovadia
