Dr. Ovadia is a board-certified plastic surgeon specializing in gender-affirming surgery, with fellowship training in both complex gender surgery at Johns Hopkins and craniofacial plastic surgery. His practice offers facial feminization surgery (FFS), top surgery, vaginoplasty, breast augmentation, and body contouring. Formerly the Director of the Rutgers Center for Transgender Health at Rutgers New Jersey Medical School, Dr. Ovadia sees patients in New York City and New Jersey.
